OL,3,AMiley Cyrus marries Maxx Morando in
OL,4,ACalifornia ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrammy-winning Cyrus, who donned a
OL,7,Fwhite dress for the wedding, confirmed
OL,8,Fher engagement to the 28-year-old
OL,9,Fdrummer during an interview with US TV
OL,10,Fshow Good Morning America last year.
